## 6. Commissioning notes

- Tag/address export: see `addressing/CEDAR_INTAKE_PS1_addressing.csv`.
- Do not expose this M340 outside VLAN 50. Only the HMI ({{ ww_net }}.40.10)
  and this engineering workstation ({{ ww_net }}.40.20) are permitted to poll
  it on tcp/502.
- LL_PROTECT_EN is a life-of-equipment interlock. Never leave it cleared after
  pump maintenance — restore to 1 before returning the station to AUTO.
